### Hardware breakthrough
**Polarity:** Beneficial (global), can be conditional
**Severity:** Minor → Major
New hardware tier becomes available at favorable cost.
**Counters / conditions:**
- Cash on hand → required to capitalize.
- Efficiency upgrades → larger savings unlocked.

### Demand surge
**Polarity:** Beneficial (global)
**Severity:** Minor → Major
A new use case (e.g. seasonal, viral consumer trend) lifts demand at a quality tier.
**Counters / conditions:**
- Inference capacity headroom → required to actually capture the surge; otherwise it spills to competitors.

### Whistleblower / leak
**Polarity:** Conditional, targeted
**Severity:** Major
A leak surfaces an internal weakness — but only fires meaningfully against players with low Security or Privacy levels. High-security players are immune.

